WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.720
Job hunting is a full-time job.

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:04.825
Let JobWatch do the busywork.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.030
Sign in, pick your role, your city, and your pay floor.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:12.823
Choose instant, daily, or weekly alerts, by email, Telegram, or Discord.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.080
New matches arrive on your schedule.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.465
Or tap Find jobs now, and get a brief in your inbox.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.280
Swipe to sort: apply, maybe, or pass.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.067
Super Apply adds a twenty-four-hour timer.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.482
Every job shows pay. Posted, or a clearly labelled estimate.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.453
Track every application, from saved to offer.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:38.039
Then your application kit matches your résumé to the job, writes your cover letter and tailored résumé in Word,

00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:42.389
finds the recruiter's email, and drafts your follow-up and thank-you notes.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:48.211
It even preps you for a voice mock interview in ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, or Grok.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.980
Your data is stored in Canada, encrypted, and never sold.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.530
Delete it anytime.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.122
JobWatch. Your whole job search, in one free place.
